        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The roses told me</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;She looks around, spotting roses of varying shades. Yellow like the ones in her hand. Then peach ones, blue, coral, white, lavender, pink, andâ€”nestled at the farthest corner of the vast garden, seemingly unattainableâ€”red roses. A beautiful and bold shade that caught the sunlight almost ethereally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So whyâ€¦ Glimmer thinks again, looking down at the one in her hand. Why is it always yellow?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;â€”&lt;br&gt;A collection of all the roses Bow and Glimmer have given to each other and how their shade and meaning has changed over time, starting with the yellow ones.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
